dBPF — Licensing
================

This repository contains two categories of work under different licenses.

1. **Code** — all files under `dBPF-pocs/` (BPF programs, userspace loaders,
   shared Makefiles, harness scripts, trigger scripts) are licensed under
   the **GNU General Public License version 2 (GPL-2.0-only)**. Every BPF
   program declares `SEC("license") = "GPL"` because the kernel refuses to
   load BPF programs that call GPL-only helpers under any other license;
   the userspace loaders and harness are licensed under the same terms to
   keep the licensing model uniform across the PoC tree.

   SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

2. **Prose** — all Markdown files under `_book_chapters/`, the top-level
   `README.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`, and `CHANGELOG.md` are licensed under
   the **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
   (CC-BY-4.0)**.

   SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-4.0

The GPL-2.0-only and CC-BY-4.0 license texts follow.


